WEBVTT

00:00:19.880 --> 00:00:21.340
Who is it?

00:00:21.340 --> 00:00:23.350
It's the middle of the night.

00:00:27.780 --> 00:00:29.740
We're Security.

00:00:29.740 --> 00:00:32.290
We're conducting a search.

00:00:32.290 --> 00:00:33.710
Security?

00:00:34.230 --> 00:00:35.380
What is it?

00:00:37.410 --> 00:00:38.620
What's going on?

00:00:39.710 --> 00:00:41.140
Jack Atlas!

00:00:41.740 --> 00:00:44.150
There's a warrant for your arrest.

00:00:44.150 --> 00:00:46.610
We're taking you to headquarters!

00:00:46.610 --> 00:00:47.680
What?

00:00:50.560 --> 00:00:52.280
What are you doing?  Let me go!

00:00:52.860 --> 00:00:56.090
Why is there a warrant for my arrest?

00:00:56.280 --> 00:00:58.280
Wait!  Why Jack?

00:01:03.940 --> 00:01:05.110
Jack...

00:01:23.830 --> 00:01:28.960
Every time you're hurt, you can become kinder

00:01:29.330 --> 00:01:34.500
Stand up and you'll understand strength

00:01:34.830 --> 00:01:38.970
Don't look back and keep going

00:01:39.200 --> 00:01:44.800
Both the past and the future 
are connected to the present

00:01:44.960 --> 00:01:49.760
There's no need to fear

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:57.440
I'll keep telling you that you're not alone

00:01:58.500 --> 00:02:03.440
The passionate emotions in your heart

00:02:04.160 --> 00:02:09.200
Streak to the infinite future

00:02:09.400 --> 00:02:14.600
Dreams surpass their limits

00:02:14.860 --> 00:02:22.700
And will lead you to a bright place

00:02:49.200 --> 00:02:54.900
Suspect!?  Jack Atlas

00:02:59.010 --> 00:03:02.830
This is security camera 
footage from the highway.

00:03:05.490 --> 00:03:07.010
Wheel of Fortune!

00:03:09.990 --> 00:03:11.680
Red Dragon Archfiend?

00:03:12.070 --> 00:03:16.840
He's clearly trying to make his 
opponent crash during the Riding Duel.

00:03:17.110 --> 00:03:20.340
There were already three 
incidents in the past week.

00:03:20.880 --> 00:03:23.160
Can it be...?

00:03:23.780 --> 00:03:26.120
Do you remember something?

00:03:28.010 --> 00:03:30.750
About a week ago...

00:03:37.040 --> 00:03:42.400
Level 3 Dark Resonator tunes 
Level 5 Big Piece Golem!

00:03:44.610 --> 00:03:50.210
The three of us were doing tag 
riding training for the WRGP.

00:03:51.910 --> 00:03:55.110
Red Dragon Archfiend attacks you directly!

00:03:55.110 --> 00:03:57.840
Absolute Powerforce!

00:04:04.690 --> 00:04:06.440
That was perfect.

00:04:06.440 --> 00:04:07.640
Jack!

00:04:07.640 --> 00:04:10.090
Why didn't you use that card?

00:04:10.090 --> 00:04:11.350
What do you mean?

00:04:11.350 --> 00:04:13.140
Stop acting dumb!

00:04:13.140 --> 00:04:15.060
Show me your hand!

00:04:15.060 --> 00:04:16.170
Just like I thought.

00:04:16.170 --> 00:04:18.590
You have Trust Guardian!

00:04:18.590 --> 00:04:22.150
The purpose of this training 
is for you to master this card!

00:04:22.150 --> 00:04:24.160
How many times do I have to tell you?

00:04:24.460 --> 00:04:26.810
Stop making me repeat myself!

00:04:26.810 --> 00:04:30.740
I don't feel like using that 
silly Tuner as Synchro Material.

00:04:31.160 --> 00:04:33.260
Why are you so stubborn?

00:04:33.460 --> 00:04:37.380
Trust Guardian is a Tuner that 
protects Synchro Monsters.

00:04:37.740 --> 00:04:40.150
I think it's a useful card.

00:04:40.350 --> 00:04:43.390
Red Dragon Archfiend must be alone.

00:04:43.390 --> 00:04:46.820
If a Tuner protects it, that 
goes against my aesthetics!

00:04:46.820 --> 00:04:47.920
Are you stupid?

00:04:47.920 --> 00:04:51.790
Don't fight for your aesthetics!  
Fight for your team!

00:04:51.790 --> 00:04:52.950
Be quiet!

00:04:52.950 --> 00:04:55.760
There's nothing wrong with 
picking my own strategy!

00:04:56.000 --> 00:04:58.780
You can't battle without me!

00:04:58.780 --> 00:04:59.880
Yeah!

00:04:59.880 --> 00:05:02.910
Just like you can't do anything alone either!

00:05:02.910 --> 00:05:04.160
What?

00:05:04.160 --> 00:05:06.150
Who do you think you're talking to?

00:05:06.150 --> 00:05:07.220
Jack.

00:05:07.830 --> 00:05:09.820
We're one team.

00:05:09.820 --> 00:05:13.640
If you focus on solo play, 
we won't win the WRGP.

00:05:15.940 --> 00:05:18.320
I can't associate with you anymore!

00:05:18.320 --> 00:05:19.940
I'm quitting the team!

00:05:19.940 --> 00:05:21.000
Jack!

00:05:22.210 --> 00:05:24.620
You're going to quit and do what?

00:05:24.620 --> 00:05:26.570
It's none of your business!

00:05:26.570 --> 00:05:28.440
I'll do whatever I like!

00:05:28.440 --> 00:05:29.660
Jack, wait!

00:05:31.410 --> 00:05:33.150
Leave him alone.

00:05:33.150 --> 00:05:34.910
How many times has he done this?

00:05:35.840 --> 00:05:38.720
Jack, how could you do that?

00:05:38.720 --> 00:05:40.200
I misjudged you!

00:05:40.200 --> 00:05:41.840
I didn't do anything!

00:05:41.840 --> 00:05:43.510
That sounds wrong!

00:05:43.510 --> 00:05:48.920
Red Dragon Archfiend is a unique card.  
You have the only copy in the world!

00:05:48.920 --> 00:05:50.980
Who else would have it?

00:05:51.150 --> 00:05:52.600
I don't know.

00:05:52.600 --> 00:05:54.840
Anyway, I didn't do it!

00:05:56.490 --> 00:05:58.990
I know your plan.

00:05:58.990 --> 00:06:01.120
Since you can't do anything alone,

00:06:01.120 --> 00:06:05.950
you decided to hurt our team's reputation 
so that we can't enter the WRGP!

00:06:05.950 --> 00:06:07.550
How dare you!

00:06:07.550 --> 00:06:11.860
Do you really think I would do that?

00:06:11.860 --> 00:06:13.580
I do!

00:06:13.580 --> 00:06:14.950
Hey, Crow!

00:06:13.580 --> 00:06:16.420
You destroy everything you hate!

00:06:16.420 --> 00:06:19.580
You're a selfish kid who 
wants to inherit the world!

00:06:17.860 --> 00:06:20.040
Crow, stop it!

00:06:20.040 --> 00:06:22.750
Take it back!  Apologize!

00:06:22.750 --> 00:06:25.010
Be quiet!

00:06:25.010 --> 00:06:27.010
I'll never apologize to you!

00:06:27.010 --> 00:06:28.740
Crow, that's enough!

00:06:28.740 --> 00:06:31.130
Crow, calm down!

00:06:29.410 --> 00:06:31.440
Yusei, you should tell him off too!

00:06:31.740 --> 00:06:35.620
WRGP!  World Riding Duel Grand Prix!

00:06:35.620 --> 00:06:38.420
Your battle spirit boils!  Your soul burns!

00:06:38.420 --> 00:06:40.980
D-Wheelers, gather here!

00:06:41.690 --> 00:06:43.060
This is the news.

00:06:43.060 --> 00:06:46.260
The Public Maintenance 
Department has arrested

00:06:46.260 --> 00:06:51.280
former King Jack Atlas as a suspect 
for the D-Wheeler attacks.

00:06:51.280 --> 00:06:56.240
According to Security, the suspect 
Atlas has denied committing the crimes.

00:06:56.240 --> 00:07:00.210
He continues to claim that he's innocent.

00:07:00.210 --> 00:07:02.210
They say Atlas is the suspect!

00:07:02.210 --> 00:07:05.750
I'm super shocked!  I was a fan!

00:07:08.210 --> 00:07:09.180
Hey...

00:07:11.540 --> 00:07:16.570
I knew Jack would do 
something sooner or later.

00:07:16.570 --> 00:07:18.740
He's cocky and not a nice guy.

00:07:18.740 --> 00:07:20.450
Stop it, Sly!

00:07:23.110 --> 00:07:24.210
What?

00:07:24.210 --> 00:07:26.210
That's enough!

00:07:26.210 --> 00:07:28.500
Jack said that he didn't do it!

00:07:29.120 --> 00:07:31.270
You're taking the side of a suspect?

00:07:31.270 --> 00:07:32.680
What did you say?

00:07:32.900 --> 00:07:34.680
Don't say bad things about Jack!

00:07:34.680 --> 00:07:36.910
Rua, please stop!

00:07:37.100 --> 00:07:39.770
What's with this article?

00:07:39.770 --> 00:07:42.280
It's completely different 
than what I asked for!

00:07:42.280 --> 00:07:45.590
Jack says that he's innocent.

00:07:45.590 --> 00:07:48.420
We should believe him a little...

00:07:48.420 --> 00:07:51.350
That won't satisfy the public!

00:07:51.350 --> 00:07:54.590
If you don't rewrite it, you're fired!

00:07:54.590 --> 00:07:56.770
What?  Editor!

00:07:59.990 --> 00:08:02.780
So you couldn't ask him anything.

00:08:02.780 --> 00:08:03.850
Yeah.

00:08:04.080 --> 00:08:05.950
It's Crow's fault.

00:08:05.950 --> 00:08:08.310
You didn't have to talk like that.

00:08:08.310 --> 00:08:10.610
Yeah, I'm sorry.

00:08:10.610 --> 00:08:12.940
I lost my temper.

00:08:13.130 --> 00:08:15.910
Can't anything be done?

00:08:15.910 --> 00:08:20.340
Since Jack's arrest, there's been no 
sightings of the D-Wheeler who caused the accidents.

00:08:20.340 --> 00:08:25.910
Furthermore, Jack doesn't have any alibis 
during the times when the D-Wheeler appeared.

00:08:25.910 --> 00:08:29.910
In other words, according to the 
evidence, Jack is in a bad situation.

00:08:30.640 --> 00:08:32.180
Oh no...

00:08:32.180 --> 00:08:35.480
Isn't there anything we can do?

00:08:36.820 --> 00:08:38.150
I know!

00:08:38.150 --> 00:08:40.640
Let's find the real criminal!

00:08:40.640 --> 00:08:44.380
There's someone pretending to 
be Jack and doing bad things!

00:08:44.380 --> 00:08:46.110
How are we going to find him?

00:08:46.110 --> 00:08:48.100
We have no leads.

00:08:48.620 --> 00:08:52.040
Unfortunately, we have to 
let Security handle this.

00:08:54.580 --> 00:08:55.930
Ushio!

00:08:55.930 --> 00:08:57.880
Hey, Ushio!  Wait!

00:08:58.350 --> 00:09:01.090
Jack isn't the type who 
would cause these incidents!

00:09:01.090 --> 00:09:02.780
You know that yourself!

00:09:03.190 --> 00:09:06.040
He's a D-Wheeler with pride!

00:09:06.040 --> 00:09:09.190
He proved that to us!

00:09:10.980 --> 00:09:12.740
I know!

00:09:12.740 --> 00:09:14.700
I really do.

00:09:14.700 --> 00:09:16.180
However...

00:09:18.940 --> 00:09:21.680
How long are you keeping me locked up?

00:09:22.420 --> 00:09:24.230
How's the investigation going?

00:09:24.230 --> 00:09:26.000
Answer me, Mikage!

00:09:26.920 --> 00:09:33.480
Due to your arrest, this case's 
investigation has ended.

00:09:33.480 --> 00:09:34.710
Impossible!

00:09:37.280 --> 00:09:40.910
Somewhere in the city, someone 
is pretending to be me.

00:09:41.240 --> 00:09:43.240
I won't forgive him!

00:09:55.630 --> 00:09:57.090
What's going on?

00:10:04.720 --> 00:10:07.190
How did he open the door?

00:10:07.190 --> 00:10:09.430
Did Master Atlas...

00:10:10.960 --> 00:10:11.950
Yes?

00:10:11.950 --> 00:10:16.710
Jack Atlas stole his D-Wheel 
and deck and escaped!

00:10:16.710 --> 00:10:18.120
What?

00:10:24.380 --> 00:10:29.860
I won't forgive anyone who tarnishes the 
names of Jack Atlas and Red Dragon Archfiend!

00:10:29.860 --> 00:10:33.580
I'll capture the real 
criminal with my own hands!

00:10:37.680 --> 00:10:39.280
Wheel of Fortune?

00:10:42.370 --> 00:10:43.980
You finally appeared!

00:10:44.170 --> 00:10:46.000
I was waiting for a while!

00:10:46.460 --> 00:10:48.940
Who are you?

00:10:48.940 --> 00:10:50.470
I'm the King!

00:10:50.470 --> 00:10:51.950
I'm Jack Atlas!

00:10:51.950 --> 00:10:53.460
Stop messing around!

00:10:53.460 --> 00:10:55.410
Why are you pretending to be me?

00:10:55.410 --> 00:10:57.110
I'm not pretending.

00:10:57.110 --> 00:11:02.110
A real King wouldn't be foolish 
enough to be captured by Security!

00:11:02.330 --> 00:11:03.220
What?

00:11:03.220 --> 00:11:06.110
You caused unnecessary trouble.

00:11:06.110 --> 00:11:09.330
But congrats for escaping.

00:11:10.060 --> 00:11:13.680
You destroyed the door?

00:11:31.750 --> 00:11:34.000
That's Jack Atlas!

00:11:34.420 --> 00:11:36.900
The former King is the suspect!

00:11:38.480 --> 00:11:41.080
How dare you!

00:11:43.490 --> 00:11:45.110
You punk!

00:11:48.410 --> 00:11:51.400
I was waiting to see that look in your eyes!

00:11:51.400 --> 00:11:53.880
The eyes of a bloodthirsty beast!

00:11:53.880 --> 00:11:54.840
What?

00:11:55.030 --> 00:11:56.190
Well?

00:11:56.390 --> 00:11:59.040
Do you feel like dueling the King?

00:11:59.210 --> 00:12:00.530
Stop messing around!

00:12:00.530 --> 00:12:03.870
Do you think I'll lose to a fake?

00:12:03.870 --> 00:12:06.010
I accept that challenge!

00:12:06.220 --> 00:12:07.700
That's the spirit!

00:12:07.700 --> 00:12:10.480
I'll show you the King's dueling skills!

00:12:10.480 --> 00:12:13.530
Speed World 2 set on!

00:12:14.110 --> 00:12:15.940
Duel Mode on.

00:12:17.100 --> 00:12:18.740
What's this light?

00:12:19.180 --> 00:12:20.510
Lane selection...

00:12:20.510 --> 00:12:22.740
Searching for optimal lane...

00:12:22.740 --> 00:12:25.740
Sending duel lane request to Central.

00:12:25.950 --> 00:12:27.480
Authorization!

00:12:28.280 --> 00:12:30.410
A Riding Duel is about to begin.

00:12:30.410 --> 00:12:33.830
Normal vehicles must leave 
the route immediately.

00:12:40.640 --> 00:12:42.110
Riding Duel!

00:12:42.110 --> 00:12:43.880
Acceleration!

00:12:58.960 --> 00:13:00.240
What?

00:13:00.430 --> 00:13:01.940
Jack escaped?

00:13:03.340 --> 00:13:04.460
Yeah.

00:13:04.460 --> 00:13:07.820
I doubt he'll come to you, 
but let me know if he does.

00:13:07.820 --> 00:13:09.040
Understood.

00:13:09.920 --> 00:13:11.510
He escaped?

00:13:11.690 --> 00:13:13.360
From Security?

00:13:13.360 --> 00:13:15.350
How could he do something so stupid?

00:13:15.350 --> 00:13:18.080
He's probably searching 
for the real criminal!

00:13:18.080 --> 00:13:21.070
That means Jack is heading towards...

00:13:23.670 --> 00:13:24.980
The highway!

00:13:27.280 --> 00:13:29.060
I go first!

00:13:29.060 --> 00:13:31.040
The King always goes first.

00:13:31.510 --> 00:13:33.070
Do whatever you like!

00:13:35.000 --> 00:13:37.690
It feels good to be chased.

00:13:37.690 --> 00:13:40.680
It makes me feel that I'm the King.

00:13:41.310 --> 00:13:43.040
My turn!

00:13:43.040 --> 00:13:46.510
I summon Dark Resonator in defense position!

00:13:50.680 --> 00:13:52.740
Dark Resonator?

00:13:52.740 --> 00:13:55.920
I set three cards and end my turn.

00:13:55.920 --> 00:13:57.140
How dare you!

00:13:57.140 --> 00:14:00.480
You're not only copying me, but 
you're also copying my monsters!

00:14:00.840 --> 00:14:02.610
It's your turn!

00:14:02.610 --> 00:14:05.320
Entertain the King!

00:14:05.320 --> 00:14:06.420
Be quiet!

00:14:06.420 --> 00:14:08.850
How dare you keep mocking me!

00:14:08.850 --> 00:14:10.980
I'll show you that I'm stronger than you!

00:14:10.980 --> 00:14:12.220
My turn!

00:14:14.910 --> 00:14:16.780
Trust Guardian.

00:14:16.780 --> 00:14:20.560
If I use this right now, I can 
bring out Red Dragon Archfiend.

00:14:20.560 --> 00:14:21.690
However...

00:14:21.930 --> 00:14:23.230
Are you stupid?

00:14:23.230 --> 00:14:27.610
Don't fight for your aesthetics!  
Fight for you team!

00:14:28.280 --> 00:14:32.740
If you focus on solo play, 
we won't win the WRGP.

00:14:33.760 --> 00:14:37.120
This isn't the time to 
remember stupid memories!

00:14:37.120 --> 00:14:39.190
I hate them all!

00:14:39.680 --> 00:14:46.240
When monsters are only on your field, 
I can Special Summon Vice Dragon!

00:14:47.110 --> 00:14:50.870
Next, I summon the Tuner 
Monster Dread Dragon!

00:14:56.490 --> 00:15:01.210
Level 2 Dread Dragon tunes 
Level 5 Vice Dragon!

00:15:01.460 --> 00:15:03.680
The King's roar reverberates!

00:15:03.680 --> 00:15:06.700
The iron hammer of victory 
will destroy the land!

00:15:06.700 --> 00:15:08.310
Synchro Summon!

00:15:08.790 --> 00:15:11.980
Take flight, Exploder Dragonwing!

00:15:14.910 --> 00:15:16.140
Battle!

00:15:16.140 --> 00:15:20.080
Exploder Dragonwing attacks Dark Resonator!

00:15:20.080 --> 00:15:21.810
King Storm!

00:15:22.000 --> 00:15:24.230
Dark Resonator's effect activates.

00:15:24.230 --> 00:15:26.210
You don't have to tell me what it does!

00:15:26.210 --> 00:15:31.500
I'm fully aware that Dark Resonator can't 
be destroyed in battle once per turn!

00:15:34.070 --> 00:15:37.350
I'll show you the power of 
the real Jack Atlas's deck!

00:15:37.350 --> 00:15:41.700
When Exploder Dragonwing battles a 
monster with fewer attack points,

00:15:41.700 --> 00:15:45.070
that monster is destroyed 
without damage calculation!

00:15:45.070 --> 00:15:48.710
This destruction is caused by 
an effect, not by a battle!

00:15:48.710 --> 00:15:53.940
And you take damage equal to Dark 
Resonator's attack points!  That's 1300 points!

00:15:56.910 --> 00:15:59.580
I set one card and end my turn.

00:16:00.510 --> 00:16:02.010
Weak.

00:16:03.480 --> 00:16:07.130
Weak.  Too weak.

00:16:07.130 --> 00:16:11.730
Are you underestimating the King?

00:16:12.280 --> 00:16:15.720
I'll use overwhelming power to 
devour and drink your blood!

00:16:15.720 --> 00:16:19.310
A true King performs first-rate duels 
overflowing with battle spirit!

00:16:19.310 --> 00:16:23.520
Since you don't embody that anymore, 
you are no longer the King!

00:16:23.520 --> 00:16:26.770
In fact, you're not even Jack Atlas!

00:16:28.490 --> 00:16:29.740
This guy...

00:16:30.780 --> 00:16:32.210
I...

00:16:33.020 --> 00:16:34.950
Am I afraid?

00:16:35.720 --> 00:16:37.090
Me?

00:16:44.410 --> 00:16:45.940
There's a duel ahead.

00:16:46.360 --> 00:16:47.940
It might be Jack.

00:16:54.380 --> 00:17:00.480
On the next turn, you'll see the 
true King with your own eyes!

00:17:00.930 --> 00:17:03.120
That's nonsense!

00:17:04.460 --> 00:17:06.740
I haven't lost any life points yet.

00:17:07.010 --> 00:17:09.510
He's trying to confuse me with words.

00:17:09.510 --> 00:17:11.210
I won't be confused!

00:17:11.210 --> 00:17:12.630
My turn!

00:17:13.680 --> 00:17:16.530
I activate the trap Shockwave!

00:17:16.530 --> 00:17:17.380
What?

00:17:17.380 --> 00:17:24.210
Your weak attack took away a few of my life 
points, but it allowed me to activate this!

00:17:24.210 --> 00:17:28.960
When I have less life points than you, 
I destroy one monster on the field,

00:17:28.960 --> 00:17:32.110
and we both take damage 
equal to its attack points!

00:17:32.110 --> 00:17:35.260
I select Exploder Dragonwing!

00:17:43.770 --> 00:17:45.540
I felt pain!

00:17:45.540 --> 00:17:48.280
Why am I taking actual damage?

00:17:50.000 --> 00:17:52.280
Isn't it an interesting system?

00:17:52.280 --> 00:17:55.270
It's a duel where you're 
literally risking your life.

00:17:55.270 --> 00:17:58.240
Taking damage from the King 
is on a whole different level!

00:17:58.240 --> 00:17:59.960
What's so funny?

00:17:59.960 --> 00:18:03.580
Due to your effect, you also 
lost a lot of life points!

00:18:04.130 --> 00:18:08.460
If the King attacked you with full strength 
from the start, you'd be finished in an instant!

00:18:08.460 --> 00:18:12.270
A King's duel must be entertaining!

00:18:13.100 --> 00:18:15.260
I summon Mad Archfiend!

00:18:18.910 --> 00:18:22.120
Mad Archfiend has 1800 attack points.

00:18:22.120 --> 00:18:25.450
If its attack succeeds, I'll 
run out of life points.

00:18:25.450 --> 00:18:26.910
I won't let that happen!

00:18:26.910 --> 00:18:29.840
The Continuous Trap Powerful Rebirth!

00:18:30.020 --> 00:18:36.570
I Special Summon a Level 4-or-below monster 
from my graveyard, and I equip it with this card!

00:18:36.570 --> 00:18:40.720
I Special Summon Dread Dragon from 
my graveyard in defense position!

00:18:40.910 --> 00:18:46.480
Due to Powerful Rebirth's effect, it 
gains 100 defense points and 1 Level!

00:18:48.360 --> 00:18:54.600
Now even if Mad Archfiend deals piercing 
damage to me, I'll still have 300 life points left.

00:18:54.600 --> 00:18:56.990
The Continous Trap Powerful Rebirth!

00:18:56.990 --> 00:18:59.840
What?  You also have Powerful Rebirth?

00:18:59.840 --> 00:19:02.500
I Special Summon Dark 
Resonator from my graveyard!

00:19:03.430 --> 00:19:07.850
Did you think that I was just going 
to attack with Mad Archfiend?

00:19:07.850 --> 00:19:09.040
Don't kid yourself!

00:19:09.040 --> 00:19:13.550
A true King uses overwhelming 
power to make the opponent submit!

00:19:15.270 --> 00:19:17.980
There's only one King, and it's me!

00:19:19.680 --> 00:19:22.640
Watch the King's duel in amazement!

00:19:23.040 --> 00:19:27.980
Level 4 Dark Resonator tunes 
Level 4 Mad Archfiend!

00:19:28.610 --> 00:19:30.110
Level 8!

00:19:30.610 --> 00:19:32.040
Can it be?

00:19:32.040 --> 00:19:35.550
The pulse of the King now forms a line here!

00:19:35.550 --> 00:19:37.940
Witness the power of the rumbling heavens!

00:19:40.700 --> 00:19:42.380
Synchro Summon!

00:19:42.620 --> 00:19:46.310
My soul!  Red Dragon Archfiend!

00:19:49.380 --> 00:19:51.280
This is impossible!

00:19:51.280 --> 00:19:56.140
Red Dragon Archfiend is a 
monster that's only in my deck!

00:19:58.240 --> 00:20:02.240
Red Dragon Archfiend attacks Dread Dragon.

00:20:02.240 --> 00:20:04.890
Absolute Powerforce!

00:20:07.010 --> 00:20:08.610
There's no mistake.

00:20:08.810 --> 00:20:10.580
This overwhelming power is real.

00:20:10.940 --> 00:20:13.190
Then I flip over my trap card!

00:20:13.190 --> 00:20:14.860
Lineage of Destruction!

00:20:14.860 --> 00:20:15.540
What?

00:20:15.740 --> 00:20:19.300
On the turn I destroy your 
monster in defense position,

00:20:19.300 --> 00:20:24.010
I select a Level 8 monster on my field, 
and it can attack a second time.

00:20:24.010 --> 00:20:27.710
Red Dragon Archfiend attacks you directly!

00:20:31.710 --> 00:20:34.140
No way!

00:20:41.190 --> 00:20:45.740
Someone other than me can use 
Red Dragon Archfiend this well?

00:20:46.980 --> 00:20:48.410
Who is he?

00:20:49.250 --> 00:20:53.350
You're a stupid pet who 
lost its fangs and claws!

00:20:53.350 --> 00:20:56.500
Burn this image into your phony eyes!

00:20:56.840 --> 00:20:59.810
The true figure of Jack Atlas!

00:21:14.390 --> 00:21:15.980
Jack!

00:21:15.980 --> 00:21:18.140
Why did you escape?

00:22:08.460 --> 00:22:13.140
The small cliff floats on the Milky Way

00:22:13.140 --> 00:22:18.150
The sights I see are different 
than what I imagined

00:22:18.430 --> 00:22:23.050
Were you able to move on from the past?

00:22:23.050 --> 00:22:28.060
The answer isn't no, but 
there's something missing

00:22:28.260 --> 00:22:32.930
The cruel god tests us

00:22:33.230 --> 00:22:39.860
Let's fill the emptiness 
and head to the next stage

00:22:39.860 --> 00:22:43.730
If you ask me "What's our relationship?"

00:22:43.730 --> 00:22:49.600
We're more than friends... 
but that's not quite right

00:22:49.760 --> 00:22:53.500
Bond is the proper word

00:22:53.500 --> 00:22:59.460
As we fight, we understand each other

00:22:59.460 --> 00:23:02.430
"Where are you right now?"  "On Earth"

00:23:02.430 --> 00:23:04.660
Because I'm not an astronaut

00:23:04.660 --> 00:23:09.330
I have no problems when 
I'm below the ozone layer

00:23:09.630 --> 00:23:12.190
"I know, I'm coming right away."

00:23:12.200 --> 00:23:15.660
You want to party until the morning

00:23:15.660 --> 00:23:18.910
At our special place
